Cell["\<\
Two corners of one side resolve a grid graph. Drawn at its radar coordinates \
from them, the grid is itself again, turned by 45 degrees:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"97d3d48f-d3de-4180-87c5-3ef94711b389"],

